      "description": "The function snapshots `ctx->data` into local `data` before `read_chunk_bytes(ctx, chunk.length)`, even though the streaming read path can `realloc(ctx->data, chunk.length)` and free the aliased buffer. The fix moves this assignment after `read_chunk_bytes()` so `data` is refreshed from the post-reallocation pointer."
    },
